1
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:13,166
This film is for students, parents and teachers.

2
00:00:13,226 --> 00:00:22,063
It shows how Kuark, the guide on the home page, recommends games and protects children.

3
00:00:22,773 --> 00:00:28,433
Tap Kuark in the corner of the home page and a short chat opens.

4
00:00:28,493 --> 00:00:34,266
Kuark asks your age first; tap a button or type.

5
00:00:34,976 --> 00:00:42,486
Then it asks your grade and your interests: nature, maths, space, music, sport and more.

6
00:00:42,546 --> 00:00:50,537
Pick several interests; press Recommend and the suggestions appear.

7
00:00:51,247 --> 00:00:59,067
Kuark suggests three games and says why for each: your interests, your grade, a new arrival.

8
00:00:59,127 --> 00:01:04,775
The Play button opens the game straight away.

9
00:01:05,485 --> 00:01:11,075
Not keen? Press “More like these” and Kuark brings other games.

10
00:01:11,135 --> 00:01:19,012
A suggestion is not a test result or a learning guarantee; it is a starting point.

11
00:01:19,722 --> 00:01:24,312
Kuark recognises sentences about a child’s safety.

12
00:01:24,372 --> 00:01:37,317
If a stranger wants to meet, it says what to do: don’t reply, don’t go, don’t share your details, and tell an adult you trust right away.

13
00:01:38,027 --> 00:01:45,453
When the panel closes, the conversation is deleted.

14
00:01:46,163 --> 00:01:53,903
Kuark is rule-based: it answers with ready-made sentences and never repeats what you wrote.

15
00:01:53,963 --> 00:02:03,758
It suggests games from clues about age, grade and interests, and shows the reason for each one.

16
00:02:04,468 --> 00:02:11,898
On topics such as self-harm, abuse or meeting a stranger, Kuark points the way to help.

17
00:02:11,958 --> 00:02:22,063
It does not answer swearing or insults, rejects praise of violence and gives no opinion on religion or politics.

18
00:02:22,773 --> 00:02:32,203
What you type is processed on your device; usage signals are sent only if voluntary research participation is on.

19
00:02:32,263 --> 00:02:42,402
Devices that tell Kuark they are under 13 never see the research question, and Kuark is hidden in board mode.

